# The node_modules directories in these sub-directories are test fixture data,
# not real installed packages. They must be committed so the unit tests in
# node_resolve.rs can resolve against them without requiring a pnpm install step.
# The workspace-root .gitignore blanket-ignores node_modules/; this file
# negates that rule for this fixture tree (at all depths).
!*/node_modules/
!*/node_modules/**
!*/*/node_modules/
!*/*/node_modules/**
